  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Unearth Secrets and Master the Mind</p></blockquote><p>The Knowledge Domain values learning and understanding above all. Its Clerics study esoteric lore, collect old tomes, explore secret places, and examine the workings of the mind; to them, knowledge is worth more than wealth, and learning is an act of worship. Libraries, universities, and other centers of learning also draw on its power.</p><p>Its gods range from masters of arcane magic to patrons of craft and invention; in Faerûn, Clerics of this domain worship deities of learning and ingenuity such as Oghma and Gond.</p><h3>Knowledge Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.t1FCA14VI9sVXfcL]{Blessings of Knowledge}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jwpgs0ap6RAyVydP]{Knowledge Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.InVlzxYEQWNlqVGo]{Mind Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iSSCNL0KDqMyFmOx]{Unfettered Mind}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7ecrXKAM8C4cSXnD]{Divine Foreknowledge}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Knowledge Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCommand000]{Command}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplComprehend]{Comprehend Languages}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectMagi]{Detect Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectThou]{Detect Thoughts}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplIdentify00]{Identify}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMindSpike0]{Mind Spike}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplNondetecti]{Nondetection}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTongues000]{Tongues}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplArcaneEye0]{Arcane Eye}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBanishment]{Banishment}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConfusion0]{Confusion}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLegendLore]{Legend Lore}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.VJ23XwclWFt6DIQF]{Synaptic Static}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
